---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Diagnostic workflow">
  <h1>Diagnostic workflow</h1>
  <p>A repeatable process helps separate symptoms from causes. This flow is a general information-organizing aid, not a replacement for Volvo's guided diagnostic procedures.</p>

  <figure class="diagram">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 720 470" role="img" aria-labelledby="diag-title diag-desc">
      <title id="diag-title">Vehicle fault diagnosis workflow</title>
      <desc id="diag-desc">A flow from recording the warning and conditions, through a full scan and guided tests, to repairing the verified cause and confirming the result.</desc>
      <defs><marker id="diag-arrow" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L6 3 L0 6" fill="none" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.2"/></marker></defs>
      <g fill="#f6f6f6" stroke="#444" stroke-width="1.5">
        <rect x="205" y="18" width="310" height="58" rx="5"/>
        <rect x="205" y="112" width="310" height="58" rx="5"/>
        <rect x="205" y="206" width="310" height="58" rx="5"/>
        <rect x="205" y="300" width="310" height="58" rx="5"/>
        <rect x="205" y="394" width="310" height="58" rx="5"/>
      </g>
      <g fill="#222" font-size="17" text-anchor="middle">
        <text x="360" y="43">1. Record the warning and symptoms</text><text x="360" y="63" font-size="12">Photograph message; note conditions and odometer</text>
        <text x="360" y="137">2. Preserve diagnostic evidence</text><text x="360" y="157" font-size="12">Full module scan, codes, status, freeze-frame</text>
        <text x="360" y="231">3. Follow VIN-specific test procedure</text><text x="360" y="251" font-size="12">Inspect and test; do not guess from code text</text>
        <text x="360" y="325">4. Repair the verified cause</text><text x="360" y="345" font-size="12">Use correct parts, fluids, and service data</text>
        <text x="360" y="419">5. Verify the repair</text><text x="360" y="439" font-size="12">Recheck operation and scan for returning faults</text>
      </g>
      <g stroke="#333" stroke-width="2" fill="none" marker-end="url(#diag-arrow)">
        <path d="M360 76 V112"/><path d="M360 170 V206"/><path d="M360 264 V300"/><path d="M360 358 V394"/>
      </g>
    </svg>
    <figcaption>General diagnostic sequence. Safety-critical faults may require stopping immediately and arranging recovery before diagnosis continues.</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <h2>Before clearing a code</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Save the complete scan, not just the engine module.</li>
    <li>Record the module, full code, status, occurrence count, and available freeze-frame data.</li>
    <li>Record recent repairs, battery events, weather, and the exact conditions when the fault appeared.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Related pages</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="../troubleshooting/">Troubleshooting overview</a></li>
    <li><a href="../troubleshooting/awd-warning/">AWD warning and diagnosis</a></li>
    <li><a href="../technical/diagnostics/">OBD-II diagnostics</a></li>
    <li><a href="../technical/diagnostic-codes/">Diagnostic code reference</a></li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
